    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "$(thing)Upgrades/$ are craftable items which can be inserted into machines and some tools to enhance their functionality in some way. To add upgrades to tools, you will need a $(l:machines/charging_station)Charging Station/$.$(p)The precise effect of each upgrade varies by device; it's documented in the machine's GUI, or (for items) in the Charging Station's upgrade GUI."
